==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
The [[present participle]] of the verb ''[[ríða á]]'', literally formed by ''[[ríða á]]'' meaning "to be [[urgent]]" + ''[[-andi]]'' meaning "[[-ing]]". 
===Adjective===
